{"page":244,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.13528525259412869,"w":0.82210917287058638,"y":0.93850400512463106,"h":0.023742250033787271,"text":"such recollections become for us an occasion of thanksgiving?","conf":1},{"x":0.13776722509675551,"text":"Even in the hours of evil and degradation God's hand has","conf":1,"y":0.91860465136948111,"w":0.81947742808948854,"h":0.020383444097306969},{"h":0.021848467607346711,"text":"held us and abased us, and we recognize His prevenient","conf":1,"x":0.13539192912057513,"y":0.89384920629670184,"w":0.82422801426478798},{"y":0.8720238092535133,"text":"grace which wills to turn them into a blessing for us.","x":0.13539193213762366,"w":0.72684082427582175,"conf":1,"h":0.020418050743284732},{"conf":1,"x":0.16864610193408958,"w":0.78859854363775872,"h":0.020441121525234585,"text":"How much also which we did not formerly understand","y":0.85019841275208663},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"now becomes illuminated in its true significance! Each of us","y":0.82703488423548621,"x":0.13539194021723916,"h":0.021923449304368847,"conf":1},{"h":0.020377676638345887,"text":"may question himself. I will only recall an episode from","y":0.8037790698651206,"x":0.13539193273505409,"w":0.82185269640637693,"conf":1},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"Proust's novel A la recherche du temps perdu. In a retrospective","x":0.13539193336450775,"h":0.018901116318172817,"y":0.78343023297658643,"conf":1},{"text":"survey of his childhood, there emerges to the surface of the","x":0.13539193992032697,"y":0.7571924601874469,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.021877306794363394,"conf":1},{"x":0.13539193130987598,"w":0.82185269640637681,"conf":1,"y":0.73536706304151356,"h":0.021900378522418773,"text":"artist's mind a certain characteristic scene, namely the"},{"y":0.71354166646014494,"conf":1,"x":0.13776722012984005,"h":0.021923449304368736,"text":"memory of his anguish which he suppressed before his father","w":0.81947742808948854},{"conf":1,"y":0.69186046553061065,"x":0.13776723005094618,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020441121525234696,"text":"and to which he gave free expression when his mother came"},{"h":0.021871538389296785,"conf":1,"text":"to kiss him good-night. That time has long since been","x":0.13776722600085101,"y":0.66860465167734673,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"text":"swallowed up in the mists of oblivion, and the child's sobs","conf":1,"y":0.64533730140561552,"h":0.021825396825396859,"w":0.82185269640637681,"x":0.13539194364162549},{"h":0.021836931743319132,"y":0.62351190500593301,"x":0.13539194576355729,"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"have long died away. \"But in truth that anguish has never","conf":1},{"text":"faded, and to-day I hear it afresh only because life around","conf":1,"x":0.13539194049039818,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.60168650813252866,"h":0.021860003471374512},{"h":0.020585317460317443,"conf":1,"y":0.57837301575513567,"text":"me has now grown silent-like those convent bells which in","x":0.13776723239231017,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"y":0.5566860469051953,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020446889930301304,"x":0.13776723005094618,"conf":1,"text":"the daytime are so heavily drowned by the noises of the city"},{"text":"that one might suppose they had ceased to sound, but which","conf":1,"x":0.13776723005094618,"y":0.53343023299323522,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020389211556268161},{"text":"in the stillness of evening are once again heard.\"","w":0.665083104913885,"y":0.51162790749130016,"conf":1,"x":0.13539193097536167,"h":0.021854235066308014},{"y":0.48725725765867944,"h":0.022952161138020011,"w":0.78882940713461358,"x":0.16851757158360697,"text":"In the stillness of evening! Let us not lose those moments","conf":1},{"y":0.46651785670925405,"x":0.13539194257274195,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.020400747420295851,"conf":1,"text":"of stillness and \"sweet silent thought\" in the confusions and"},{"w":0.32779096628164317,"x":0.13776722879504527,"y":0.44320436536923091,"text":"bustle of the garish day.","conf":1,"h":0.021911913440341046},{"w":0.79392797296697437,"h":0.027484018651265929,"conf":1,"text":"\"Eternity is silence. Change is feverish clamour. Silently","y":0.41735618793217644,"x":0.16592407399056605},{"h":0.021883075199430002,"text":"sweeps God's will over the distant spaces of earth.\"2","conf":1,"y":0.39825581392298637,"x":0.13301663343476969,"w":0.69596198936561493},{"conf":1,"text":"This thought brings us to the final words of our text. \"Take","y":0.37645348888664898,"w":0.79572444767146921,"x":0.16152019003006138,"h":0.021860003471374512},{"conf":1,"y":0.35465116326732149,"h":0.0203488365052239,"text":"heed, watch; for you do not know when the time will come.\"","x":0.13539194745341146,"w":0.8218526964063767},{"conf":1,"x":0.13539193797845309,"y":0.32986111156327258,"w":0.82422801426478809,"h":0.021883074253324475,"text":"I think that there is no need for me to speak longer about it."},{"conf":1,"w":0.46646009172712055,"h":0.025738099264720149,"y":0.29707760423838347,"x":0.30829619045341983,"text":"\"Darkness reigns and all is silent;"},{"conf":1,"y":0.27604166651465079,"w":0.32779096628164317,"h":0.021923449304368736,"x":0.3586698404221238,"text":"O thou majesty on high"},{"y":0.25570436480566672,"x":0.32541567791873854,"conf":1,"text":"Low my spirit bows before Thee","h":0.020458425794328994,"w":0.44893111191786733},{"text":"Where to enter is to die.","h":0.019597326006208116,"y":0.23391365171588641,"x":0.35838984188465317,"w":0.34026341624074175,"conf":1},{"y":0.20155452502059856,"conf":1,"w":0.42416852480405337,"text":"\"Thee the Holy in the Holiest","h":0.028317240495530416,"x":0.30569457107530235},{"x":0.35866984176742867,"text":"Through the solemn night I seek.","y":0.18168604702618396,"conf":1,"h":0.021802325097341368,"w":0.46318287044376527},{"w":0.4180522274661374,"conf":1,"y":0.15988372111269811,"h":0.020423818202245814,"text":"Silent let my soul await Thee:","x":0.32779098785046262},{"x":0.35866982871552555,"conf":1,"text":"Lord, I listen; do Thou speak.\"3","w":0.45130642977627844,"h":0.02036613982821267,"y":0.13662790745336817},{"h":0.019438367987435923,"conf":1,"y":0.11435596414197802,"text":"1 E.T. Remembrance of Things Past, 1941.","w":0.42095194234476457,"x":0.30613583364308911},{"h":0.01888890682704869,"x":0.30330586535441206,"text":"2 Wilhelm Raabe.","conf":1,"y":0.10146722881477721,"w":0.19867006524816733},{"w":0.24114219863693442,"conf":1,"text":"3 Gerhard Tersteegen.","h":0.019097600664411241,"x":0.54329142595030611,"y":0.099473632256327993},{"text":"248","conf":1,"x":0.52019002383915836,"y":0.077034883985760194,"h":0.020348836505223789,"w":0.054631827713607195}]}